## 1. Definitions

- **"Licensor"** means Didier PH Martin, the copyright holder.
- **"You"** means the person or organisation using the Software.
- **"Individual User"** means a natural person using the Software for their
  own personal, noncommercial purposes.
- **"Corporate User"** means a company, organisation or other legal entity,
  or a person acting on its behalf.
- **"Admin App"** means the administration application and the login service
  the Licensor supplies with the corporate package, and any copy of them.
- **"Container"** means a Docker (or compatible) image of the Software,
  including the PHP backend and every other file it contains.
- **"Intranet"** means computer systems owned or controlled by a Corporate
  User and accessible only to its employees and contractors.
- **"LLM Keys"** means credentials for large language model providers.
- **"Subscription"** means a paid plan from the Licensor that supplies access
  to the large language models the Software supports, within a usage limit.
- **"Credits"** means prepaid usage bought from the Licensor that supplies
  access to those models on a pay-as-you-go basis.
- **"Licensor Account"** means an account with the Licensor through which You
  hold a Subscription or Credits.

